ound artists I wanted to be around  creative people and tom was was the most  creative person I'd ever met the most  curious they became collaborators on  magazine articles theater projects and  finally this book it's always  interesting when you lay out a body of  work hmm you know what you see yes I  think I was able to really show the  evolution of an artist this book is a  10-year labor of love their fanciful  pictures they're dreamy pictures they're  gorgeous pictures yeah they're really  remarkable pictures it's and it's  incredible to me to when you think about  it you know he put down his camera you  know for a long time and yet this  incredible body works you know is still  there I think it's remarkable as well  how Patricia Bosworth kills just look at  this in such an objective way and  appreciate his talent and have  absolutely not a hint of jealousy I mean  personally it's just fascinating to see  that dynamic she really understood is  great it's a great book

